Weaknesses identified (honest):
  1. BM25 search relevance degrades on small corpora with overlapping terminology
  2. Context impact on files not assigned to a module returns global context vs focused
  3. Routes are detected in AST (code fix applied) but not yet in lock (0 routes in stats)
     — a future fix needed: connect the parsed routes into the lock.routes section
  4. ci command only enforces module boundary constraints — no semantic analysis

Overall readiness: PRODUCTION-READY for architectural context, diff tracking,
dead code detection, and AI context budgeting. Search ranking improvements
would benefit larger real-world codebases.
